killbill-kintsugi-plugin 0.1.0
---------------------------------------

* Initial release: invoice plugin delegating tax to Kintsugi L2 API
* HMAC-authenticated calls to `/killbill/tax/estimate` and `/commit`
* Per-tenant config via `uploadPluginConfig/killbill-kintsugi`
* Retry on transient failures (`InvoicePluginApiRetryException`)
